file pond/apps/scooter_compose.rye the Session -- membership-gated open, empty-guarded submit turning a typed line into a post, the composed frame, the tracked caret
file tools/scooter_compose_witness.rish builds the module and asserts its selftest speaks GREEN over the six cruxes
file crux/REMEMBER.md git nib and live edge refreshed to the scooter_compose living edge, in the work commit
file session-logs/README.md newest-first index row prepended
recommend keep-going the terminal family's read+write loop is closed and usable locally; the only rungs left -- the live keystroke reader (a raw TTY) and the Comlink transport between two Constel piers -- both reach the serve gate (the maintainer's hand). The next ungated agent-doable crux is another Season-balancing move: an open-media video rung, a Brix config strand, or a crypto parity door if a named gap opens.
